# --- app-level overrides (downstream leaf apps) ---
# Append-only, so everything above stays byte-identical across the base and every
# app built on it and merges cleanly. servebase (the base) ignores package-lock.json;
# a deployable leaf app should re-include and commit its lockfiles here for
# reproducible `npm ci` installs by adding:  !package-lock.json
# (node_modules/**/package-lock.json stays ignored: its parent dir is excluded.)
